BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Can I Kiss You?
DTSTART:20260902T220000
DTEND:20260902T230000
DTSTAMP:20260829T144739Z
UID:73c6b797dd2a9e3831ee5810685cec@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Presented in partnership with The Center for Respect Required 
 for all first-year students Wednesday\, 9/2 | 6:00 p.m. and 8:00 p.m. Stud
 ents must attend one of the two sessions. Sessions are 1 hour long. “Can
  I Kiss You?” is an interactive program that helps students think about 
 consent\, respect\, communication\, and healthy relationships in real and 
 practical ways. Led by Mike Domitrz\, this nationally recognized session u
 ses humor\, stories\, and direct conversation to give students tools they 
 can use in everyday life. During the program\, students will learn how to 
 better understand consent\, communicate clearly\, respect boundaries\, and
  step in when something does not seem right. The session is designed to he
 lp build a campus community where everyone feels valued\, respected\, and 
 safe. To learn more about the upcoming presentation of ““Can I Kiss Yo
 u?” program \, email the Assistant Director of Prevention & Education\, 
 Jill Kelley at jckelley@holycross.edu. If you are unable to attend your de
 signated session\, you must contact Jill Kelley\, Associate Director of Pr
 evention and Education\, at jckelley@holycross.edu at least 72 hours befor
 e your scheduled session. If an emergency or unexpected situation arises a
 fter that time\, you should email as soon as possible. Need an accommodati
 on? Please contact Student Accessibility Services at hcaccessibilityservic
 es@holycross.edu. --- Event Details: https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=21
 52244\n\nSource: College of the Holy Cross\nEvent page: https://myhc.holyc
 ross.edu/rsvp?id=2152244
LOCATION:Hogan Ballroom\, The College of the Holy Cross\, Hogan Campus Cen
 ter- Suite 506\, Worcester\, MA 01610\, United States
URL:https://myhc.holycross.edu/rsvp?id=2152244
END:VEVENT
