DESCRIPTION:Please join us in the Chapel of the Holy Spirit at 11:30 a.m. 
 on Thursday\, September 10\, 2026\, as we celebrate the Mass of the Holy S
 pirit. Tracing its roots back to a tradition that began in the Middle Ages
 \, this mass asks God to bless\, sustain\, and direct each member of a Cat
 holic university through the upcoming academic year. We welcome the commun
 ity to come together in prayer and ask God to bless us and our common work
 .\n\nSource: Assumption University\nEvent page: https://www.assumption.edu
 /news-and-events/events/mass-of-the-holy-spirit
LOCATION:Chapel of the Holy Spirit\, 500 Salisbury Street\, Worcester\, MA
 \, 01609
