BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bionics Club Thumb Workshop
DTSTART:20260914T210000
DTEND:20260914T220000
DTSTAMP:20260829T144739Z
UID:acbb8e6e6159803cdff87a95518f9c@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Build your own bionic thumb from start to finish! No experienc
 e required. We will walk you through how to CAD\, 3D Print\, wire\, and co
 de a finger that bends in response to a flex sensor. All materials will be
