  open to all Holy Cross students\, faculty\, and staff. It is a low-pressu
 re environment to talk about reading and share a love of books. During thi
 s event we will also discuss what is planned for the rest of the semester 
 and take your input about what you would like the Book Club to do. For mor
 e information about the Library Book Club\, visit https://libguides.holycr
 oss.edu/bookclub or email libbookclub@holycross.edu --- Event Details: htt
