DTEND:20260923T164500
DTSTAMP:20260829T144739Z
UID:d14ffcd8484a6a0786c0ba89d380f4@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a way to make your day less stressful and more min
 dful...take some much-needed time for yourself and join us for Mindful Wed
