BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:10/25 Neighborhood Cleanup
DTSTART:20261025T143000
DTEND:20261025T160000
DTSTAMP:20260829T144739Z
UID:e85d82e7a8b77e08e38adc12fb7d95@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun fall activity and support your larger Worces
 ter community by Caring for Our Common Home! Trash cleanups will involve w
 alking a short loop around the local neighborhood (Boyden\, Clay\, and Car
 o Sts)\, picking up trash along the way. All materials will be provided fo
 r events. Coffee and bagels will be provided at all events from 10:30 to 1
