BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Saving and Investing: How to Get Started
DTSTART:20261117T230000
DTEND:20261118T001500
DTSTAMP:20260829T144739Z
UID:8062ad78605ba76ea198e34d7a95c4@worcester-colleges
DESCRIPTION:Think you need to make a lot of money before you can start sav
 ing or investing? Think again. The earlier you understand saving and inves
 ting\, the more time your money has to work for you. This workshop will br
 eak down the basics in straightforward language and help you understand wh
 ere to begin—even if you’re starting with a small amount. We’ll expl
 ore: ● Why saving and investing are different ● Building an emergency 
 fund ● Short-term vs. long-term financial goals ● How compound growth 
 works ● The basics of investment accounts and retirement accounts ● Ri
 sk\, diversification\, and why they matter ● How to get started when you
  don’t have much money Meeting Link: TBD --- Event Details: https://mywp
 i.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=403497\n\nSource: Worcester Polytechnic Institute\nEvent
  page: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=403497
LOCATION:Online Event
URL:https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=403497
END:VEVENT
